      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UPSTREAM (2) looks close to a win after coming from tougher barriers to finish second in her last two outings here. Registered a strong performance last start when she raced parked but battled on bravely to finish only 1.5m away. Likely to get the favours from this nice draw so could break through. KARAOKE KING (4) overcame a wide barrier when he won at this venue two runs ago before finishing third at his latest appearance, beaten 4 metres. Going well so can make an impact again. ULTIMATE RHAPSODY (3) has put together some nice efforts at this circuit and distance including a win two back and a last-start placing. Draws to play a role again. TEN GALLON (1) did well to place from back line here on Monday and should get every chance from the inside draw.",
